  "description": "The film and media major focuses on screen storytelling, providing students with opportunities to study digital media and how it communicates in film, television, and new media platforms, advertising, and other digital media arts. The film and media major provides an integrated liberal arts foundation emphasizing the intersections of faith, culture, and film and media as art, communication, an institution, and commercial product. Overlap Policy This program may not be combined with the applied film and media major, digital communication, film and media major: production concentration, or film and media minor.",
